Strip a .git suffix only at the end of a repository name.

replace('.git', '') removes the substring anywhere, so a repository whose name
legitimately contains it is mangled. notofonts/notofonts.github.io became
notofonts/notofontshub.io, and every tags/branches API call 404ed, breaking
media-fonts/noto.

https://github.com/Tatsh/livecheck
